// own 64 heads against every selected key, its own online softmax and its own
// PV slice, so no cross-warpgroup hand-off is needed.
//
//   Q  [128,576] bf16  : 9 dim tiles of 16 m-blocks x 8 k-cores (128 B cores)
//   KV [16 keys,576]   : 72 dim-cores (2 key-cores + 16 B pad) = 272 B each
//   P  [128,16]  bf16  : 16 m-blocks x 2 key-cores
