//   Q  [128, 576] bf16 : 9 dim tiles of 16 row slabs x 8 k-cores
//   KV [16, 576]  bf16 : 72 dim cores, each 2 key cores (+ 16 B pad)
//   P  [128, 16]  bf16 : 2 head halves of 8 row slabs x 2 k-cores
